data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":1154,"safety_buffering":false,"response":{"id":"resp_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a5c8df48191b7aa7206f8b3bdc8","object":"response","created_at":1793010268,"completed_at":1793010288,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","access_programs":{"cyber":"standard"},"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"You translate the supplied natural-language proof faithfully into Lean 4. Use the explicit project premises and any proved result in the pinned Mathlib environment. Preserve all assumptions, conclusions, equality modes and the supplied proof route. No reference answers, personal context, other tasks, shell or external services are available. Use the submit tool when the requested artifact is complete; if rejected, repair it. A strategy is advice, never an additional theorem or assumption. End this stage immediately when a submit tool reports stage_complete:true; the controller handles later stages. Within a proof stage, checked helper attempts are available through read_lean_draft. After a context reset, query its index before claiming no draft or helper exists. Helpers never become new premises. Use familiar interfaces directly; no background-note scan is required. For a relevant obstacle, select a matching local background_note_index entry and read_background_note if its details may help. Relate the actual Lean goal/context to its NL step: use the note grounds to identify a small missing application premise or transport, prove it from permitted inputs, then check the intended application. Verify actual types and conditions; a note is not a Lean proof or extra assumption. If it does not fit, continue ordinary allowed search or repair without insisting on that note or rebuilding a larger argument by default.","output":[{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a5e27948191b0a11c0138c5712c","call_id":"call_b0918184acd14b0bab66f7c0a81e5deb","name":"check_transition","arguments":"{\"proof\":\"have hxM : ∀ m ∈ M, x m ∈ M := by\\n  intro m hm\\n  simpa [LR.DP] using h_H006.2.1 1 m hm\\nhave hyM : ∀ m ∈ M, y m ∈ M := by\\n  intro m hm\\n  simpa [LR.DP] using h_H006.2.2 1 m hm\\nhave hhM : ∀ m ∈ M, h m ∈ M := by\\n  intro m hm\\n  rw [← h_H004.2.2.1.2.2]\\n  exact M.sub_mem (hxM _ (hyM _ hm)) (hyM _ (hxM _ hm))\\nlet xz : Module.End ℤ M := (x.restrictScalars ℤ).restrict hxM\\nlet yz : Module.End ℤ M := (y.restrictScalars ℤ).restrict hyM\\nlet hz : Module.End ℤ M := (h.restrictScalars ℤ).restrict hhM\\nhave bx : LR.Brackets xz yz hz := by\\n  rcases h_H004.2.2.1 with ⟨h1,h2,h3⟩\\n  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩\\n  · ext m\\n    apply Subtype.ext\\n    simpa [xz, yz, hz, LinearMap.mul_apply] using congrArg (fun f : Module.End ℂ V => f m) h1\\n  · ext m\\n    apply Subtype.ext\\n    simpa [xz, yz, hz, LinearMap.mul_apply] using congrArg (fun f : Module.End ℂ V => f m) h2\\n  · ext m\\n    apply Subtype.ext\\n    simpa [xz, yz, hz, LinearMap.mul_apply] using congrArg (fun f : Module.End ℂ V => f m) h3\\nhave ops : Nonempty (LR.IntegralOps M x y h) := by\\n  exact ⟨{ xz := xz, yz := yz, hz := hz,\\n    Xz := fun r => ((LR.DP x r).restrictScalars ℤ).restrict (h_H006.2.1 r),\\n    Yz := fun r => ((LR.DP y r).restrictScalars ℤ).restrict (h_H006.2.2 r),\\n    x_agree := fun _ => rfl, y_agree := fun _ => rfl, h_agree := fun _ => rfl,\\n    X_agree := fun _ _ => rfl, Y_agree := fun _ _ => rfl, brackets := bx }⟩\\nhave span_pres (f : Module.End ℂ V) (hf : ∀ m ∈ M, f m ∈ M) :\\n    ∀ m ∈ LR.MR p M, f m ∈ LR.MR p M := by\\n  intro m hm\\n  induction hm using Submodule.span_induction with\\n  | mem m hm => exact Submodule.subset_span (hf m hm)\\n  | zero => simpa using (LR.MR p M).zero_mem\\n  | add a b ha hb ia ib => simpa using (LR.MR p M).add_mem ia ib\\n  | smul a b hb ib =>\\n    change f (algebraMap (LR.R p) ℂ a • b) ∈ LR.MR p M\\n    rw [map_smul]\\n    exact (LR.MR p M).smul_mem a ib\\nhave hlp : lam.toNat < p := by omega\\nhave units : ∀ t, t ≤ lam.toNat → IsUnit (t.factorial : LR.R p) := by\\n  intro t ht\\n  have hnd : ¬ p ∣ t.factorial := h_H001.coprime_iff_not_dvd.mp\\n    (h_H001.coprime_factorial_of_lt (lt_of_le_of_lt ht hlp))\\n  have hndi : ¬ (p : ℤ) ∣ (t.factorial : ℤ) := by exact_mod_cast hnd\\n  have hmem : (1 / (t.factorial : ℚ)) ∈ LR.R p :=\\n    (h_T005 _).mpr ⟨1, (t.factorial : ℤ), by exact_mod_cast Nat.factorial_ne_zero t,\\n      hndi, by simp⟩\\n  apply isUnit_iff_exists_inv.mpr\\n  refine ⟨⟨_, hmem⟩, ?_⟩\\n  apply Subtype.ext\\n  change (t.factorial : ℚ) * (1 / (t.factorial : ℚ)) = 1\\n  simp [Nat.factorial_ne_zero]\\nrefine ⟨ops, (fun r => span_pres _ (h_H006.2.1 r)),\\n  (fun r => span_pres _ (h_H006.2.2 r)), units, ?_⟩\\nintro j hj\\nhave hid : (lam.toNat.choose j : LR.R p) * (j.factorial : LR.R p) *\\n    ((lam.toNat-j).factorial : LR.R p) = (lam.toNat.factorial : LR.R p) := by\\n  exact_mod_cast Nat.choose_mul_factorial_mul_factorial hj\\nhave hu := units lam.toNat le_rfl\\nrw [← hid] at hu\\nexact isUnit_of_mul_isUnit_left (isUnit_of_mul_isUnit_left hu)\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"Search the pinned mathlib Lean source using a regular expression; at most 100 lines.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"Read specified lines of a Mathlib/*.lean source file from the pinned checkout.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_transition","description":"Compile a tactic body for the fixed target; no leading by, declarations, or placeholders.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"proof":{"type":"string"}},"required":["proof"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_transition","description":"Submit and check the final tactic body for the same target.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"proof":{"type":"string"}},"required":["proof"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_auxiliary","description":"Compile one helper proposition and tactic body in exactly this local port context. This never accepts the final goal or adds a premise.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"statement":{"type":"string"},"proof":{"type":"string"}},"required":["statement","proof"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_lean_draft","description":"Read only your own same-stage proof/helper attempts. kind=index lists attempts; proof/auxiliary returns the selected body lines and actual check. No other stage or file is accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["index","proof","auxiliary"]},"candidate":{"type":"integer"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["kind","candidate","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_background_note","description":"Read one complete audited background note from this task index by its qualified ID. No other task, file or proof is accessible; this is guidance, not a checked Lean proof.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false}],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":false,"prompt_cache_key":"063ae445-1e69-4aa8-8783-7de08c2bbdd7","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"low"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"effort":"high","context":"all_turns","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":17742,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1230,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0},"total_tokens":18972,"attribution":{"items":{"fc_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a4aae788191bd7d853c79d2e511":{"input_tokens":33,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a52f8388191bb048b2f8a7b568b":{"input_tokens":52,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a5754e48191bcdec9158b2a9dae":{"input_tokens":41,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a5b58b88191b48e8a81e712b1f2":{"input_tokens":25,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a5e27948191b0a11c0138c5712c":{"input_tokens":2,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1230},"fco_01a177bd-38ab-71e0-9f62-883c0ad3f804":{"input_tokens":4646,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"content":[{"input_tokens":4646,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}]},"fco_01a177bd-5a1f-7f01-8fc4-e6c61b8ef1c9":{"input_tokens":4720,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"content":[{"input_tokens":4720,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}]},"fco_01a177bd-6759-7d70-bc1b-b872dabb1596":{"input_tokens":917,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"content":[{"input_tokens":917,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}]},"fco_01a177bd-756c-7682-98e7-3cebd185f6c1":{"input_tokens":724,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"content":[{"input_tokens":724,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}]},"msg_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a5c8edc8191bac54167f738b7f3":{"input_tokens":5855,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"content":[{"input_tokens":5855,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}]},"rs_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a52cd4c81918c9f2d5418570229":{"input_tokens":54,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"rs_0c59696b615daf21016adf2a5b31e48191b25cc67c46119568":{"input_tokens":12,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"request_fields":{"instructions":{"input_tokens":266,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"tools":{"input_tokens":395,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}},"tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"total_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0},"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0}},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"safety_identifier":"user-EpSBagPYSg8yOGllmjblVHlJ","store":false,"metadata":{},"max_output_tokens":null,"max_tool_calls":null,"service_tier":"default","truncation":"disabled"}}

